From d13161067e730b2ebdafe5f8e7b025fc17fd8d2b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bezko <bezkom@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 05:32:38 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Add stereo audio track with Equal-Power panner.
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Shift+click +A creates 2in2out stereo (pan_width capable).
--smoke-stereo-track: add → assert 2in + width → remove (Dummy exit 0).
---
